    "body": "## Problem\n\n`vim.iter(q):skip(2):slice(1, 2)` returns `{}` and `vim.iter(q):rev():slice(1, 2)` returns every item. `slice()` derives the number of items to drop from the end from the raw `_tail` index instead of the remaining length. The docstring formula is also off by one (`len - last + 1` instead of `len - last`).\n\n## Solution\n\nCompute the remaining length as `math.abs(self._tail - self._head)` and use `len - last` for the `rskip()` count. Fix the docstring.\n\nFixes #42475",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-19T22:40:08Z",
